<title>UK: Sullom Voe oil liftings fall, VLCC sails for U.S..</title>
<headline>Sullom Voe oil liftings fall, VLCC sails for U.S..</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Loadings of Brent crude from Britain's Sullom Voe terminal totalled 600,436 tonnes in the week to December 23, down from the previous week's 696,430 tonnes, the Shetlands Islands Council Marine Operations said.</p>
<p>Over half the shipments were destined for British refineries but one VLCC sailed to the U.S.</p>
